[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5685319142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123502#issuecomment-5685319142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123502","id":5685319142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUt8V5g","user":{"login":"realybin","id":172874642,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk3bkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172874642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin","html_url":"https://github.com/realybin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T17:56:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T17:56:48Z","body":"Pasting is stripped by `LineEdit::paste_text`; but accepting Tab input in the search box is probably not a good choice, as it may interfere with Tab navigation.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/00462d686e310710896ed88596fb267a8ce16b8b/scene/gui/line_edit.cpp#L1767-L1773\n\nI see that Visual Studio Code / Visual Studio / CLion can all paste tabs, but likewise cannot input them; pressing Tab navigates to other controls.\n\nI also noticed that in Godot, you can select \\t content to search, but the search box does not display a visible-width (\\t), and copying it into another text editor yields \\t: `LineEdit::set_text` does not strip it the way `LineEdit::paste_text` does. I think this is an inconsistency.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/00462d686e310710896ed88596fb267a8ce16b8b/editor/gui/code_editor.cpp#L613\n\n<img width=\"768\" height=\"471\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d696852-c995-4b6f-a1ab-7ee535376d6a\" />\n\nI think solving this may require supporting the display of these characters in LineEdit.\n\nAlso, as far as I can tell, only CLion and its family support multi-line search.\n\nHope this helps. 😀","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5685319142/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5688549925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123502#issuecomment-5688549925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123502","id":5688549925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUxBiJQ","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T21:47:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T21:47:55Z","body":"- Adding regex support would also allow searching for tabs with \\t https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15303","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5688549925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5712154556","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123502#issuecomment-5712154556","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123502","id":5712154556,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVHiPvA","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T09:33:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T09:33:05Z","body":"I believe tabs should be allowed to be pasted, like VSCode. I've also used gedit, a more basic text editor, and it used the same convent